      <UserObject label="IMPLEMENTATION STATUS — This sequence is target design, not current code. Walking skeleton state/dedupe are process-local and publication is synchronous; listener failure can follow the memory-state write. Inbound DeviceReading.eventId differs from each outbound DomainEvent.eventId. M3 VehicleFailed reaction is proven; M4/M5/M8 reactions are not verified." mermaidId="n:m6-implementation-status" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fff5ad,#2a2a2a);strokeColor=light-dark(#aaaa33,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="IMPLEMENTATION STATUS — This sequence is target design, not current code. Walking skeleton state/dedupe are process-local and publication is synchronous; listener failure can follow the memory-state write. Inbound DeviceReading.eventId differs from each outbound DomainEvent.eventId. M3 VehicleFailed reaction is proven; M4/M5/M8 reactions are not verified." id="m6-implementation-status-note"><mxCell parent="1" style="html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fff5ad,#2a2a2a);strokeColor=light-dark(#aaaa33,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="90" width="2651" x="50" y="3370" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject></root>
    </mxGraphModel>
